Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Local Wi-Fi file sharing and folder sync
 hopo sends files, folders, text and links directly between computers
 on the same local network, keeps shared spaces and two-way folder sync,
 and lets phones join through a browser without installing an app.
 .
 This package bundles its own .NET runtime.
